<Base title="About" description="What Rulebook is, what it is not, who runs it, and what stays in your browser.">
<div class="wrap prose reader-intro"><PageIntro title="About" summary="What Rulebook does, who runs it and what stays on your device.">About</PageIntro></div>
<div class="wrap prose"><h2>What it is</h2><p>Rulebook is an educational site about investing with discipline. It publishes four strict, rules-based screens and a paper book of at most 30 calls, runs a paper-trading terminal that holds you to limits you set while calm, helps you write a one-page plan, and keeps a public record of every simulated call, trade and void.</p>
<h2 data-u="mt6">What it is not</h2><ul><li><strong>Not investment advice.</strong> A screen's list is the output of fixed rules, not a recommendation.</li><li><strong>Not a broker.</strong> No real-money trading, no broker connection.</li><li><strong>Not a tip service.</strong> Targets and stops are the paper book's exit rules, not price recommendations.</li><li><strong>Not a promise.</strong> Every figure is simulated — not real returns, and a short record says little.</li></ul>
<h2 data-u="mt6">Who runs it</h2><p>Rulebook is built and run by the individual behind <a href="https://askakshay.com/" rel="noopener">askakshay.com</a>. Contact: <a href="mailto:ca.akkothari@askakshay.com">ca.akkothari@askakshay.com</a>. It does not present itself as a SEBI-registered investment adviser or research analyst. For advice about your money, speak to a registered adviser.</p>
<h2 data-u="mt6">Why the Gate exists</h2><p><a href="https://www.sebi.gov.in/media-and-notifications/press-releases/sep-2024/updated-sebi-study-reveals-93-of-individual-traders-incurred-losses-in-equity-fando-between-fy22-and-fy24-aggregate-losses-exceed-1-8-lakh-crores-over-three-years_86906.html">SEBI’s study published on 23 September 2024</a> found that 93% of individual equity derivatives (F&amp;O) traders lost money in FY22–FY24. The Gate does not make trading safe. It makes the habits that lose money harder to repeat, on paper.</p>
<h2 data-u="mt6">Your data</h2><p>Your Gate trades, plan, watchlist and widget choices stay in your own browser. They are not sent to us. Clearing browser data removes them, so use the download buttons. The email list stores your address, the date and your consent version. Delivery has no published schedule. Contact the operator to request removal. No tracking pixels.</p>
<h2 data-u="mt6">Limits of the lock</h2><p>The Gate's lock and strict mode are self-commitment tools that live in your browser. Clearing site data or using another device bypasses them. They slow you down; they cannot stop a determined you.</p>
<h2 data-u="mt6">The method and the numbers</h2><p>How calls are chosen, the accounting and charges, the data sources, every number defined once and published method notes are on <a href="/method/">Method</a>.</p></div></Base>
